            "sid": "COL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba niinyenda ku mumanya oku ndikubarwanirira munonga imwe n'aba Laodikea, n'abandi boona abatakandeebaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ngu emitima yaabo egumibwe, nk'oku barikuteerana hamwe omuri rukundo, baheebwe obutungi bw'okwetegyereza n'okumanyira kimwe enaama ya Ruhanga; n'enaama egyo niwe Kristo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi omuri Ogwo nimwo obutungi bwona obw'obwengye n'okumanya busherekirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki ninkigamba ngu hatagira omuntu owaabahabya n'ebigambo by'okubabeihabeiha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba, n'obu ndaabe ntari naimwe omu mubiri, kwonka ndi naimwe omu mwoyo, ninshemerererwa kureeba obuteeka bwanyu oburungi n'okuhama kw'okwikiriza kwanyu omuri Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
